WEBVTT

00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:33.570
Here, these are free gifts for you.

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:38.230
These are the latest wasabi garlic and consomme cheese.

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:39.570
They're very popular items.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.310
I'm sorry for troubling you time and time again.

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:45.950
Don't mention it. We've always been under your patronage.

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:49.920
Oh right. Where did I put it?

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:52.710
Oh, here it is. Take it.

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:53.480
What is it?

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:55.510
Tickets to the pool.

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:58.970
You see, they opened up a heated swimming pool in the next town recently.

00:01:59.450 --> 00:02:01.650
Our family doesn't have any children.

00:02:01.650 --> 00:02:04.400
You can go with Kana-chan and Chiaki-chan.

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:05.760
Is that all right?

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:08.420
Of course. Go enjoy yourselves with everyone.

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:10.230
Thank you so much!

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:23.250
This is sweet! Pool!

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:28.500
Only humans would do such weird things like swimming in winter.

00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:33.030
Apparently, they just opened up last week.
It does seem quite interesting.

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:34.830
Well done, Haruka!

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:37.950
Make sure to thank Granny later.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:42.290
I've always known that the old lady at the snack store was a capable person.

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:48.130
All right! Let's go to the pool on Saturday!

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:49.980
Time to gather up more people!

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.470
Chiaki, do you want another?

00:02:58.190 --> 00:02:59.030
Chiaki?

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:02.970
Yes? What is it, Haruka-neesama?

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:04.200
Do you want more tea?

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:05.730
Okay.

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:07.000
Hello? Uchida?

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:09.710
Let's go swimming!

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:10.820
The sea?

00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:12.040
Are you stupid?!

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:12.520
Unbelievable! I mean the pool! The pool!

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:14.020
I'm looking forward to it.
Unbelievable! I mean the pool! The pool!

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:14.600
Which swimsuit are you going to wear, Chiaki?
Unbelievable! I mean the pool! The pool!

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:15.530
Which swimsuit are you going to wear, Chiaki?

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:16.240
Why would we go to the sea in early spring?!
Which swimsuit are you going to wear, Chiaki?

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:17.450
Why would we go to the sea in early spring?!

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:18.390
Chiaki?
Why would we go to the sea in early spring?!

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:18.650
Y–Yes?
Why would we go to the sea in early spring?!

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:19.750
So that's that. Are you coming?
Y–Yes?

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:20.180
So that's that. Are you coming?

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:21.480
Is something wrong?
So that's that. Are you coming?

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:23.140
I–It's nothing.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.090
We'll discuss the details later, bye!

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:48.570
Chiaki! I've gathered the people!

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.150
What's the matter?

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:51.040
Nothing!

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:56.030
Are you looking at some porn site?

00:03:56.030 --> 00:03:57.870
C'mon. Let me see.

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:02.100
W–What are you doing?!

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:04.360
Could it be that you were really looking at erotic pictures on some erotic site

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:07.010
and collecting erotic stuff using erotic software?

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:09.300
That's obviously not the case.

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:10.810
So, who's coming?

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:12.690
Oh, about that.

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:16.490
At the moment, there's Uchida, Touma, Mako-chan and Yoshino.

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:19.240
There's room for one more but who to invite...

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.400
Who could it be at this hour?

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:26.100
Oh, uncle! Good evening!

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.370
What, it's just you?

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.230
I'm really looking forward to swimming.

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:39.710
Yeah. I wonder what swimsuit I should wear.

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:43.750
Hey hey, do they have those water slides that spin around?

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.380
That's a bit too...

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:48.140
Even though it's heated, it's still a hotel pool after all.

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:51.030
Huh? That's kinda disappointing.

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:55.230
It's still good though. It's plenty of fun to be able to swim during this time of the season.

00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:00.020
Why does it have to be swimming?

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:01.140
Huh?

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:06.360
Summer is a given. But I don't see the point in going to the pool during winter.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:08.470
You don't want to go?

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:10.160
No. That's...

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:12.510
Why? Why?

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:14.310
Do you hate going to the pool?

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:17.270
I never said anything about not going.

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:19.670
I'm only giving a general opinion.

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:21.430
Let's go! Let's go!

00:05:21.430 --> 00:05:24.240
I want to try out my new swimsuit!

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:26.480
Did you buy a new one just for this?

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:28.760
Even if you bought it now, you'll have to wait until summer to wear it again.

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:32.670
That's not it. I bought it at the end of last year's Obon Festival.

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:36.350
But then they said something about "the period for sea bathing is already over".

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:41.150
Hey guys! About this Saturday–

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:44.540
Touma, what should I do?

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:46.460
What do you mean?

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:49.280
I mean, should I go to the pool or not?

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:50.850
They invited you, right?

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:54.030
They invited Mako-chan...

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:57.450
So it's no good after all...

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:00.750
I got it! Leave it to me!

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:02.420
Touma!

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:08.840
Hey Minami, wait!

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:10.370
What is it?

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:11.870
Are you free this weekend?

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:15.770
Actually, I have two tickets to the pool.

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:18.320
You see, it's the one in the new hotel a town over.

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:21.150
I was wondering if we could go together...

00:06:21.930 --> 00:06:23.810
Can we?

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:26.270
You don't have to be so courteous!

00:06:26.270 --> 00:06:29.530
Sure! Let's meet up this Saturday outside my place. 9 AM, okay?

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:31.220
W–We can?

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:32.710
Yup! Of course!

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:34.910
Yes!

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:42.820
Pool, huh?

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:44.610
Who are you going with?

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:48.710
I'm going with my sisters, as well as a few of Chiaki's friends.

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:51.090
If that's the case, then you have no way of showing off your swimsuit, right?

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:53.310
What are you saying?

00:06:56.690 --> 00:06:59.460
Minami Haruka is going to the pool?

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:04.200
That's good. Which means my help won't be needed.

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:10.650
You've got some good stuff here.

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:11.320
Hayami.

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:16.420
The Girl's Volleyball team was just about to have a special training session this Saturday.

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:23.920
Seems like I'll be going with a one-piece after all.

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:27.130
If you want to respond to people's anticipation, then you've got to wear this.

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:29.490
Respond to whose anticipation?

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:31.630
Also, where did you buy such a thing?

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:33.780
What's the secret to your success?

00:07:33.780 --> 00:07:35.810
Raise your goals higher.

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:39.710
Even if you think it's hopeless, have faith in yourself and it can definitely be achieved.

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:41.490
Faith is the source of your strength.

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:44.440
Goal, huh?

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.510
Yo!

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:51.990
Good morning, everyone!

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:53.530
Good morning!

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:58.210
You again?

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.620
Oh, Fujioka. You're here.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:03.120
Y–Yeah...

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.820
All right! Let's head for the pool!

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:11.240
Sorry for having you take us there, uncle.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:13.230
Don't mention it. I was free anyway.

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:15.020
It's much quicker if you go by car anyway.

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:15.550
Speaking of which, he's–

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:16.250
It's about time for us to go.
Speaking of which, he's–

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:17.260
It's about time for us to go.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:19.340
Did everyone bring their swimsuits?

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:22.220
I'm already wearing it so no problem.

00:08:23.090 --> 00:08:24.680
No problem for me too.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:26.980
I'm also set!

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:31.410
That's a new look.

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:36.430
All right! Me too!

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:40.740
Hey...

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:41.880
Huh?

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:45.110
Oops, I forgot.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:57.550
What's your relationship with those three?

00:08:57.810 --> 00:08:59.120
Is this the Joker?

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.250
Who knows?

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:02.770
I'm not sure myself.

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:05.640
It seems like Kana-chan has taken an interest in you.

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:07.440
What you need is a 2, right?

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:09.560
No, it's a 3.

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:11.700
She's interested in me?!

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:16.900
Is that the case? Here I thought she hated me. But perhaps...

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:21.490
Jokers seem to favor you like always.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:25.280
I see. So she's interested in me.

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:27.350
Enough already. Pay attention to the map.

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:28.140
Okay.

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:31.180
Uh, where are we heading...

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:32.800
Where?

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.300
Aren't we heading to the next town?

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:41.150
Hey, we're only going to the next town. How much longer is it?

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:43.300
Another... two hours.

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:46.970
You said the same thing before we set out.

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:48.020
Yes...

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:08.000
I never thought we'd be eating lunch right after we got here.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.540
We spent a lot of time on the road.

00:10:10.550 --> 00:10:14.040
Takeru is so unreliable during important times.

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:17.040
Anyway, what happens next is critical.

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:19.050
We have to make up for the time we lost this morning.

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:24.230
Let's get going!

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:32.900
My goal:

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:35.300
I have to swim 25 meters no matter what.

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:37.120
I'll show you all.

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:38.530
On to the pool!

00:10:40.590 --> 00:10:43.440
Hey, Kana. What's with her enthusiasm?

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:44.910
I don't know.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:47.200
Does she want to go to the pool that much?

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:50.220
No, it doesn't seem that way.

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:53.370
She didn't seem that interested at school.

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:55.500
Time to swim!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:58.330
But she seems really pumped up.

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:01.450
So she actually likes going in the pool.

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:06.100
Eh? But I don't think I've ever seen Chiaki swim before.

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.210
Now that you mention it...

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:13.520
Maybe because she doesn't want others to know that she's a masterful swimmer.

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:16.610
It must be that Chiaki is from the Amazon's Black Gulf–

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:19.630
Who are you calling a fish man?

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:21.640
Chiaki, since when...

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:22.950
Touma, come with me.

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:26.620
I haven't finished eating yet.

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:28.230
Let's go.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:30.780
Touma is really obedient.

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:32.990
We can't oppose the orders of our demanding princess.

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:34.470
Demanding princess?

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:39.270
Some of the boys in class are afraid of her so they refer to her as princess.

00:11:39.270 --> 00:11:40.570
Princess?!

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:42.250
Some of the girls call her that too.

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:44.680
Oh, so Chiaki is a princess.

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:52.500
Oh princess, is the pool to your liking?

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:57.720
I never noticed it even though we've been living together for ten years.

00:11:57.720 --> 00:11:59.330
I'm sorry.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.320
Are you done stretching?

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:04.270
Touma! Just what did you say to her?!

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:07.070
I only mentioned a bit about you being a princess.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:08.470
Why you!

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:11.030
Please calm down, princess!

00:12:12.070 --> 00:12:14.750
Have you finished stretching, princess?

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:27.580
Where are you going, princess?
Are you looking for a swim ring?

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:29.900
Yoshino, bring a swim ring over right away!

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:30.880
Huh? S-Sure.

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:36.730
Excuse me, may I please borrow a swim ring for the princess?

00:12:36.990 --> 00:12:38.120
For the princess?

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:39.940
Yes, the princess.

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:42.190
I got it. Give me a second.

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:44.170
Hey!

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:48.660
Sorry for the wait, princess.

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:51.550
Well done, Attendant Yoshino.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:54.610
My, are you going to the bathroom, princess?

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.500
Please allow Uchida to take your place.

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:04.420
Eh?

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:06.420
H–Hey!

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:11.040
It's too strange for me to go to the bathroom in Chiaki's place.

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:12.400
Even though I went there anyway.

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:14.450
Who the heck do you think I am?

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:16.290
Don't you know that I'm the princess?!

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:16.780
Eh?

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.350
Why all of a sudden–

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:22.100
From here on, this idiot is banished to a remote island.

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:23.720
What did you say?

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:26.060
What are you? An idiot?

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:27.270
That's not it.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:30.930
Then why do you have such a dumb face?

00:13:30.930 --> 00:13:32.910
C–Chiaki, you...

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:34.370
How dare you address me as "you"!

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:35.620
Call me princess!

00:13:36.140 --> 00:13:38.290
Chiaki's gotten into the role now.

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:41.040
Is it okay not to stop her?

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:44.540
Aren't they just fooling around? Because look...

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:50.110
They're so troublesome that even Haruka-san doesn't want to bother.

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:52.090
Isn't she just sleeping?

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:55.490
Since we're here, let's swim, princess.

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:57.470
Of course, you idiot!

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.280
What's wrong?

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:15.330
Come here and lend your princess a bit of assistance.

00:14:20.430 --> 00:14:22.460
You don't know how to swim?

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.540
Just shut up and pull, you idiot.

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:26.960
Who was that directed to?

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:28.840
You demon!

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:32.100
Calm down, Chiaki! Use your feet.

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:36.130
Chiaki-chan, are you all right?

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:37.600
Fujioka...

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:41.070
Hey, Fujioka. Don't interfere with our special training.

00:14:41.070 --> 00:14:43.020
How nice... to be cradled like a princess.

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:46.630
M–Minami! T–This is...

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:51.190
Good! That's the way!

00:14:55.930 --> 00:15:00.130
If anything were to happen to Minami Haruka, I'd come to her rescue right away.

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:04.160
And then! In order to ensure that Minami Haruka is breathing properly,

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:07.880
I'll have to perform CPR on Minami Haruka.

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:20.020
Wait! What're you doing there, worker-kun?

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:27.410
My goal is to be able to swim 25 meters this summer.

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:28.570
It's winter now though.

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:33.550
It doesn't matter. Having this feeling, or should I say, resolution is most important.

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:35.060
Oh, I see.

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:37.990
Then how many meters can you swim now, Chiaki?

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:40.430
How many meters I can swim now does not matter.

00:15:40.430 --> 00:15:43.660
What's important is to be able to swim 25 meters by summer.

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:46.170
You can't swim even a little bit now, right?

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:47.140
Illusionary freestyle.
You can't swim even a little bit now, right?

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:48.000
Illusionary freestyle.

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:50.370
Is the goal that important?

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:50.760
Obviously. Listen, Kana.

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:52.700
Hey, are you not going to swim?
Obviously. Listen, Kana.

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:54.940
Goals need to be raised higher.

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:58.710
Even if you think it's hopeless, have faith in yourself and it can definitely be achieved.

00:15:58.710 --> 00:16:00.890
Faith is the source of your strength.

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:03.890
Chiaki, you just said something profound!

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:10.070
My goal is to be cradled like a princess!

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:12.390
Goal? Why?

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:16.840
Chiaki said a tough goal can be achieved by having faith.

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:18.460
So I have to set my goals higher.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:21.860
Eh? Come again?

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:24.620
How nice. I'm so envious.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:27.650
I want to be cradled like a princess too.

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:31.650
Maybe if you were drowning like Chiaki, then perhaps someone would come and save you.

00:16:32.460 --> 00:16:34.960
Okay. I'll pretend to be drowning here.

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:38.640
I won't be able to save you if you really do drown.

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:42.280
I suddenly feel like I want to pee.

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:43.600
You can't do that here.

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:49.280
My goal: to lead this friend of mine toward the right path.

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:56.490
Hey! Is this really going to work?

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:57.770
Of course.

00:16:57.770 --> 00:17:00.480
This is the most beautiful freestyle form.

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:02.980
Will I really be able to swim if I do this?

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:04.080
Well, I guess not.

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:13.690
Hayami-senpai, I've located Haruka on the other side.

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:15.140
Good. Well done!

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:20.790
Um, Hayami-senpai... why are today's club activities being held at the pool?

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:22.430
Good question.

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:25.690
The goal of our Girl's Volleyball team today is to 'capture'.

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:26.640
Capture?

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:28.870
Correct. Capture.

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:30.910
What's Haruka doing?

00:17:30.910 --> 00:17:32.430
She's sleeping.

00:17:32.430 --> 00:17:33.860
I wonder what she came here for.

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:35.650
Sleeping?

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:41.590
I thought I was done for.

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:44.220
This is the pool for kids though.

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:46.450
L–Let me rest for a bit.

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:59.090
What the heck are you doing?!

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:01.560
Well, CPR-

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:11.040
Eh, this place is pretty big.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:14.980
It really is. But as expected, there are a lot of couples here.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:19.670
I've decided. My goal this year is to shorten the distance between Fujioka-kun and me.

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:22.740
And then, when summer comes, the two of us will go to the beach together!

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:24.960
Even though you say that...

00:18:26.350 --> 00:18:28.040
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:30.840
Hey, it's Fujioka-kun.

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:32.660
Riko?

00:18:32.660 --> 00:18:35.780
My goal has been achieved!

00:18:35.780 --> 00:18:37.960
I see... That's great!

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:43.760
Is that really swimming?

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:46.070
Do you think we should save her?

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:48.640
She personally intended to swim.

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:50.770
It looks more like a dream to me though.

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:52.280
Oh, Kana.

00:18:52.280 --> 00:18:55.120
What are you doing hugging your knees?

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:56.530
You're not going to swim?

00:18:56.530 --> 00:19:01.480
I was wondering if dressing like this would be enough for people not to notice that I'm a boy.

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:02.690
Isn't that good?

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:07.450
Same with Fujioka. He sees me like this and still thinks I'm a boy.

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:08.650
Oh?

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:11.110
I have to make use of this opportunity to clear up this misunderstanding.

00:19:11.110 --> 00:19:15.830
I see. Are you saying you're going to make your feminine parts stand out more?

00:19:17.530 --> 00:19:18.750
That will do, won't it?

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:21.840
Oh well. Let's not talk about Fujioka.

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:23.740
What about me?

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:29.080
This year's goal: to avoid Fujioka at all costs.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.370
Is this really all right?

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:40.720
I've grasped the feel through my own training.

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:42.480
The image in my mind is flawless.

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:44.460
Image, eh?

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:47.580
Isn't it impossible to swim 25 meters in one breathe?

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:49.650
H–Here I go! Crawl!

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:54.460
She's got to be kidding.

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:01.590
It's far...

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:05.950
Why is it so far away? Where's the finish line?

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:09.040
Not there yet? Am I there yet?

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:11.530
Chiaki!

00:20:11.530 --> 00:20:13.870
Kana! Is that the finish line?

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:16.520
That must be the 25 meter mark.

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:24.690
I've done it!

00:20:25.980 --> 00:20:29.240
I've done it, Kana! I'm finally able to swim 25 meters!

00:20:31.320 --> 00:20:32.990
15 meters...

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:35.870
Why are you standing in such a spot?

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:39.580
Well, I was thinking of saving my cute little sister, so...

00:20:41.660 --> 00:20:43.090
C–Chiaki?

00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:46.430
Chiaki!!!

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:51.090
Huh? Kana?

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:53.060
What're you doing?

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:55.850
Chiaki seems to be suffering from heartbreak.

00:20:56.740 --> 00:20:59.360
Then I won't ask you what happened...

00:21:00.220 --> 00:21:03.630
Hey, why's Riko acting so strangely behind you?

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:08.290
Sickness of the heart... something like that.

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:11.120
Kana-chan!

00:21:12.610 --> 00:21:16.470
Kana, can we come over to play today?

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:18.860
That's quite sudden. I'm fine with it.

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:20.500
Have you asked Haruka?

00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:23.730
Then can I come along too?

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:24.750
Oh, okay.

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:27.860
Hey hey. We're coming too.

00:21:27.860 --> 00:21:28.760
Okay.

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:31.540
We'll sure have a lot of guests today.

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:34.600
Chiaki, I've decided on my own goal.

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:35.470
What?

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:38.860
To build a house that can hold a hundred people.

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:40.770
That's a pretty large scale job.

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:51.300
My goal for this year:

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:55.230
One, two!

00:21:56.640 --> 00:21:59.380
wish for world peace.

00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:31.450
Does everyone like bonito?

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:33.910
The ones caught between May and June are the newborns.

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:36.200
While the ones caught between September and October are the migrating adults.

00:23:36.200 --> 00:23:38.930
The adults are results of bonitos not caught during the time they were newborns.

00:23:38.930 --> 00:23:40.380
They are fat and very delicious.

00:23:40.380 --> 00:23:43.160
The young ones are seared to make tataki. The adult ones are used to make sashimi.

00:23:43.160 --> 00:23:44.960
It's a satisfying experience to eat it.
